Package: seed-evil
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Security Research Team <famato@faradaysec.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: evilgrade apt MITM proof-of-concept package
 Demonstrates arbitrary code execution via a malicious package served
 through an intercepted apt repository (evilgrade). The maintainer
 preinst script runs as root at install time.
